## ❓ Troubleshooting

**"File not found" error:**
- Make sure the file is in: `c:\Users\jayas\Downloads\calculator\`
- Try using the file explorer to navigate to the file and open it directly

**Data not saving:**
- Check if your browser allows local storage
- Try a different browser
- Clear browser cache and reload

**Link not working:**
- Make sure you're using the exact path
- Check if the file exists in the Downloads folder
- Try copying the path from File Explorer

---

